{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p><br /></p><p>### 55-1. Sārammaṇaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-45-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-45a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23119.10274600286\">6:25:19</span> 1. Sārammaṇaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sārammaṇo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (yathā sappaccayaṃ kusalaṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) ^7-45a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23131.11892403147\">6:25:31</span> 2. Sārammaṇaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sārammaṇo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (yathā sappaccayaṃ akusalaṃ, evaṃ kātabbaṃ.) ^7-45a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23143.690401234602\">6:25:43</span> 3. Sārammaṇaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sārammaṇo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-45a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23152.852609077247\">6:25:52</span> Anārammaṇaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anārammaṇo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23161.761275997138\">6:26:01</span> Sārammaṇaṃ abyākatañca anārammaṇaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sārammaṇo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23174.010989908445\">6:26:14</span> 4. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā pañca…pe… aññamaññe cha…pe… purejāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45a-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23184.95362302003\">6:26:24</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… nakamme dve, navipāke pañca, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne dve, namagge nava, nasampayutte tīṇi, navippayutte dve, nonatthiyā tīṇi, novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇa-adhipatipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23209.071857054358\">6:26:49</span> 5. Sārammaṇo abyākato dhammo sārammaṇassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-45a-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23218.279870965667\">6:26:58</span> 6. Sārammaṇo abyākato dhammo sārammaṇassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-45a-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23227.119866223158\">6:27:07</span> Anārammaṇo abyākato dhammo sārammaṇassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23236.307202048636\">6:27:16</span> 7. Sārammaṇo abyākato dhammo sārammaṇassa abyākatassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi. Anārammaṇo abyākato dhammo sārammaṇassa abyākatassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45a-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23263.17574797139\">6:27:43</span> 8. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā cattāri, anantare ekaṃ…pe… sahajāte satta, aññamaññe cha, nissaye satta, upanissaye dve, purejāte ekaṃ, pacchājāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme tīṇi, vipāke tīṇi, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45a-8</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 56-1. Cittaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-45b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-45c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23288.43855700286\">6:28:08</span> 9. Cittaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-45c-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23297.928819902725\">6:28:17</span> Nocittaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nocittaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca citto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nocittaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca citto kusalo ca nocitto kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23321.440478297547\">6:28:41</span> Cittaṃ kusalañca nocittaṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23330.482493856947\">6:28:50</span> 10. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca (sabbattha pañca), avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45c-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23335.88976914019\">6:28:55</span> Naadhipatiyā pañca, napurejāte pañca, napacchājāte pañca, naāsevane pañca, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke pañca, navippayutte pañca (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23349.5428721688\">6:29:09</span> (Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23355.23617082834\">6:29:15</span> 11. Nocitto kusalo dhammo nocittassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Nocitto kusalo dhammo cittassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Nocitto kusalo dhammo cittassa kusalassa ca nocittassa kusalassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (3) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-45c-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23369.398314988557\">6:29:29</span> 12. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava…pe… sahajāte aññamaññe nissaye pañca, upanissaye āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, āhāre indriye pañca, jhāne magge tīṇi, sampayutte pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45c-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23375.292797068665\">6:29:35</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23379.3436323376\">6:29:39</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23382.696880942778\">6:29:42</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23385.604472271796\">6:29:45</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23398.507307831198\">6:29:58</span> 13. Cittaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-45c-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23409.51623691417\">6:30:09</span> Nocittaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nocittaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca citto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nocittaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca citto akusalo ca nocitto akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23434.84512304864\">6:30:34</span> Cittaṃ akusalañca nocittaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23444.650356097274\">6:30:44</span> 14. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca…pe… avigate pañca. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Cittadukakusalasadisaṃ, nahetuyāpi kattabbaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi kātabbaṃ). ^7-45c-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23459.644641008585\">6:30:59</span> 15. Cittaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-45c-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23471.149586117303\">6:31:11</span> Nocittaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nocittaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca citto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nocittaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca citto abyākato ca nocitto abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23496.843031756813\">6:31:36</span> Cittaṃ abyākatañca nocittaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23507.328646157355\">6:31:47</span> 16. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca…pe… vipāke pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45c-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23513.116840962808\">6:31:53</span> Nahetuyā pañca, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā pañca…pe… napurejāte napacchājāte naāsevane pañca, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke pañca, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne pañca, namagge pañca, nasampayutte tīṇi, navippayutte pañca…pe… novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23533.130364937057\">6:32:13</span> (Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23538.29221617166\">6:32:18</span> 17. Nocitto abyākato dhammo nocittassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (cittadukakusalasadisaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-45c-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23556.72481871962\">6:32:36</span> 18. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava…pe… sahajāte pañca, purejāte tīṇi, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, vipāke pañca, vippayutte pañca, atthiyā pañca, natthiyā nava…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45c-18</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 57-1. Cetasikaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-45d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-45e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23575.964899676703\">6:32:55</span> 19. Cetasikaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cetasikaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca acetasiko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cetasikaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko kusalo ca acetasiko kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-45e-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23602.896777025748\">6:33:22</span> Acetasikaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23610.270707925614\">6:33:30</span> Cetasikaṃ kusalañca acetasikaṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23619.18101586553\">6:33:39</span> 20. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca, adhipatiyā pañca…pe… avigate pañca. ^7-45e-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23629.819541954224\">6:33:49</span> Naadhipatiyā pañca, napurejāte pañca…pe… nakamme tīṇi, navipāke pañca…pe… navippayutte pañca (saṃkhittaṃ, sahajātavārādi vitthāretabbo).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23643.35560193706\">6:34:03</span> 21. Cetasiko kusalo dhammo cetasikassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45e-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23651.66415810872\">6:34:11</span> 22. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava (ādimhi tīṇi, sahajātādhipati, majjhimesu tīsu majjhimānulomikāyeva pañhā, sahajātādhipati,) anantare nava…pe… sahajāte pañca…pe… upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, āhāre pañca, indriye pañca, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte pañca, atthiyā pañca, natthiyā nava…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45e-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23687.266752024414\">6:34:47</span> 23. Cetasikaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cetasikaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca acetasiko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cetasikaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko akusalo ca acetasiko akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-45e-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23713.049890228882\">6:35:13</span> Acetasikaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23720.47049201831\">6:35:20</span> Cetasikaṃ akusalañca acetasikaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23731.527963006105\">6:35:31</span> 24. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ, yathā kusalanayaṃ evaṃ nahetupaccayampi kātabbaṃ). (Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-45e-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23746.718951021365\">6:35:46</span> 25. Cetasikaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cetasikaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca acetasiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cetasikaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko abyākato ca acetasiko abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-45e-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23777.578521969484\">6:36:17</span> Acetasikaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca acetasiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23787.638896100707\">6:36:27</span> Cetasikaṃ abyākatañca acetasikaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23799.396882935915\">6:36:39</span> 26. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… purejāte āsevane pañca, kamme nava, vipāke nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45e-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23806.91177385962\">6:36:46</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava (sabbe kātabbā)…pe… nakamme cattāri, navipāke nava, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne cha, namagge nava, nasampayutte tīṇi, navippayutte cha…pe… novigate tīṇi. (Saṃkhittaṃ, sahajātavārādi vitthāretabbo).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23833.491888874876\">6:37:13</span> 27. Cetasiko abyākato dhammo cetasikassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45e-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23844.04253675891\">6:37:24</span> 28. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava (ettha chasu sahajātādhipati), anantare nava…pe… sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, purejāte tīṇi, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, vipāke nava, āhāre nava, indriye nava, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte pañca, vippayutte pañca, atthiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45e-28</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 58-1. Cittasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-45f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-45g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23874.468628030518\">6:37:54</span>29. Cittasampayuttaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45g-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23883.89591115564\">6:38:03</span> 30. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45g-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23893.301477984744\">6:38:13</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23897.843245112916\">6:38:17</span> 31. Cittasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45g-31</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23907.457892987793\">6:38:27</span> 32. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) ^7-45g-32</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Abyākatapadaṃ – hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23916.942205935913\">6:38:36</span> 33. Cittasampayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittasampayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittasampayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto abyākato ca cittavippayutto abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-45g-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23948.585526125124\">6:39:08</span> Cittavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto abyākato ca cittavippayutto abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23982.92473879553\">6:39:42</span> Cittasampayuttaṃ abyākatañca cittavippayuttaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittasampayuttaṃ abyākatañca cittavippayuttaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cittavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittasampayuttaṃ abyākatañca cittavippayuttaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto abyākato ca cittavippayutto abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24024.240493290396\">6:40:24</span> 34. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā pañca…pe… aññamaññe cha…pe… purejāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme nava, vipāke nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45g-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24039.455628886513\">6:40:39</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… napurejāte nava…pe… nakamme dve, navipāke pañca, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne dve, namagge nava, nasampayutte tīṇi, navippayutte dve (saṃkhittaṃ, sahajātavārādi vitthāretabbo).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24068.744932167847\">6:41:08</span> 35. Cittasampayutto abyākato dhammo cittasampayuttassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-45g-35</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24081.81617493286\">6:41:21</span> Cittasampayutto abyākato dhammo cittasampayuttassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24091.985989697874\">6:41:31</span> Cittavippayutto abyākato dhammo cittasampayuttassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24101.972097250244\">6:41:41</span> 36. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā cattāri, anantare ekaṃ…pe… sahajāte satta, aññamaññe cha, nissaye satta, upanissaye dve, purejāte ekaṃ, pacchājāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme tīṇi, vipāke tīṇi, āhāre cattāri, indriye cha, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45g-36</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 59-1. Cittasaṃsaṭṭhaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-45h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-45i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24141.363814847413\">6:42:21</span> 37. Cittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasaṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45i-37</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24152.512991039675\">6:42:32</span> 38. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) ^7-45i-38</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24162.94339631433\">6:42:42</span> 39. Cittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasaṃsaṭṭho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45i-39</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24172.02519124414\">6:42:52</span> 40. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) ^7-45i-40</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24182.379093926756\">6:43:02</span> 41. Cittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasaṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-45i-41</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24192.681736088503\">6:43:12</span> Nocittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocittasaṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24203.62312793286\">6:43:23</span> Cittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ abyākatañca nocittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasaṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24217.52632914343\">6:43:37</span> 42. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45i-42</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24222.43265403662\">6:43:42</span> (Yathā cittasampayuttadukaṃ abyākatasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 60-1. Cittasamuṭṭhānaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-45j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-45k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24231.85505631738\">6:43:51</span> 43. Cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocittasamuṭṭhāno kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno kusalo ca nocittasamuṭṭhāno kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-45k-43</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24265.751239115965\">6:44:25</span> Nocittasamuṭṭhānaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24274.554966880984\">6:44:34</span> Cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ kusalañca nocittasamuṭṭhānaṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24286.88367801526\">6:44:46</span> 44. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca (sabbattha pañca), avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45k-44</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24292.811237134276\">6:44:52</span> Naadhipatiyā pañca, napurejāte pañca…pe… nakamme tīṇi, navipāke pañca…pe… navippayutte pañca (saṃkhittaṃ, sahajātavārādi vitthāretabbo).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24308.727318360106\">6:45:08</span> 45. Cittasamuṭṭhāno kusalo dhammo cittasamuṭṭhānassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45k-45</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24319.19860983826\">6:45:19</span> 46. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte pañca…pe… upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, āhāre pañca, indriye pañca, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte pañca, atthiyā pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45k-46</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24345.52673813733\">6:45:45</span> 47. Cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-45k-47</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24355.327142987793\">6:45:55</span> Nocittasamuṭṭhānaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24364.80062026245\">6:46:04</span> Cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ akusalañca nocittasamuṭṭhānaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24377.30844289624\">6:46:17</span> 48. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45k-48</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24382.34644908545\">6:46:22</span> (Kusalattikasadisaṃ sahajātavārampi …pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24391.834391972534\">6:46:31</span> 49. Cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-45k-49</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24403.64197410376\">6:46:43</span> Nocittasamuṭṭhānaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocittasamuṭṭhāno abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24415.212843109864\">6:46:55</span> Cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ abyākatañca nocittasamuṭṭhānaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24429.23348092065\">6:47:09</span> 50. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā pañca (sabbattha nava), purejāte pañca, āsevane pañca…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45k-50</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24442.48302601526\">6:47:22</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe cha, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… nakamme tīṇi, navipāke cha, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne cha, namagge nava, nasampayutte cha, navippayutte cha, nonatthiyā cha, novigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24465.628380856568\">6:47:45</span> (Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24470.935297801636\">6:47:50</span> 51. Cittasamuṭṭhāno abyākato dhammo cittasamuṭṭhānassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-45k-51</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24483.58049499084\">6:48:03</span> Cittasamuṭṭhāno abyākato dhammo cittasamuṭṭhānassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24494.3261890824\">6:48:14</span> 52. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava (sabbattha nava), purejāte nava, pacchājāte nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, vipāke nava, āhāre nava (cittasamuṭṭhānamūlaṃ nocittasamuṭṭhānassa kabaḷīkāro āhāro kātabbo. Nocittasamuṭṭhāno cittasamuṭṭhānassa kabaḷīkāro āhāro ghaṭane majjhe kabaḷīkāro āhāro), indriye nava (rūpajīvitindriyaṃ ekaṃ), jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte pañca, vippayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-45k-52</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24547.28727785962\">6:49:07</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 61-1. Cittasahabhūduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-45l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-45m-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24561.977072920658\">6:49:21</span> 53. Cittasahabhuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasahabhū kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittasahabhuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocittasahabhū kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Cittasahabhuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasahabhū kusalo ca nocittasahabhū kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-45m-53</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24596.64402701831\">6:49:56</span> Nocittasahabhuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasahabhū kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24610.90425207019\">6:50:10</span> Cittasahabhuṃ kusalañca nocittasahabhuṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasahabhū kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24615.86449407019\">6:50:15</span> 54. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). (Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-45m-54</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"24624.67129706714\">6:50:24</span> 55. Cittasahabhuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasahabhū akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-45m-55</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-